s('Integration begins outside the pressure boundary.', 'An ordinary-room rehearsal develops the category interface, dialogue, accessible controls and source records. The proposed architecture keeps the validated chamber controller independent from general AI and game presentation. Operating records reach the personal system through a read-only interface.', ['External compute and acquisition resources have separate workloads and failure plans.', 'Any internal display, sensor, cable, textile, lining or fixture needs configuration-specific compatibility review.', 'The Personal Atmosphere Delivery System (PADS) remains a development option with its own circuit, controller and operating evidence.']),
s('A retrofit is an engineering project.', 'Changes to an existing device require the relevant manufacturer, technical, clinical and regulatory review. The Australian Therapeutic Goods Administration links hyperbaric fire prevention to the device instructions, qualified professionals and the operating environment.', [], ['tga-fire']),
s('What counts as a useful first result?', 'A non-pressure interface rehearsal demonstrates that a participant retrieves a source, corrects an interpretation and previews a release. A later installed configuration demonstrates timing, capture continuity, comfort and fault recovery under its actual approved procedures.')
